      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Social Media Automation\n1. Fill in **Settings**.\n2. Make a Google Sheet with a **Content plan** tab (columns in `content-plan.csv`). Add one row per post: post_id, publish_at, topic, status = idea.\n3. Every Monday the AI writes the posts and emails the approver. Change status to **approved** in the sheet to publish.\n4. Every hour the next approved post whose time has come is published (one post per hour).\n5. Connect OpenAI, Google Sheets, Gmail, Facebook Graph API (page token) and LinkedIn. X is disabled: enable it if you have API access.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
